<title>BELGIUM: Brussels airport intra-European top cargo destinat.</title>
<headline>Brussels airport intra-European top cargo destinat.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brussels airport intra-European top ten cargo destinations in 1996/1995 in thousands of metric tonnes.</p>
<p>				  1996	 1995	1996 vs 1995</p>
<p> East Midlands(UK)	  21,748     18,311    up    18.77pct</p>
<p> Copenhagen		   20,013     20,149    down   0.67</p>
<p> Bergamo(Italy)	     18,925     13,773    up    37.41</p>
<p> Madrid			 15,453     17,897    down  13.65</p>
<p> Nuremberg		    12,291     11,684    up     5.20</p>
<p> London(LHR,LGW,LCY,STN)  11,419     16,794    down  32.00</p>
<p> Luton(UK)		    10,104	8,406    up    20.20</p>
<p> Frankfurt		    10,013     10,965    down   8.68</p>
<p> Vitoria(Spain)		9,475	1,819    up   420.94</p>
<p> Cologne-Bonn		  7,857	4,081    up    92.54</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
